	<item>
		<title>By: Jason R. Rosenberg</title>
		<link>http://drownedmadonna.com/13-underrated-madonna-songs/20141230#comment-12760</link>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Jason R. Rosenberg]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Wed, 31 Dec 2014 18:53:41 +0000</pubDate>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://drownedmadonna.com/?p=3305#comment-12760</guid>
		<description><![CDATA[I think if I had a top 10 list it would be:
10. The Power Of Goodbye
9. Till Death Do Us Part
8. The Look Of Love 
7.Has To Be 
6. Run 
5. What It Feels Like For A Girl
4. Liquid Love 
3. Forbidden Love (2005)
2. Love Spent
1. Drowned World/Substitute For Love 

Honerable Mentions:
Arioso
I&#039;m In Love With Love 
Let It Will Be
Rescue Me

Also, Im not including the new tracks due to them not yet being heard but heres my top 5 for them:
5. Wash All Over Me
4. (Love You From The) Inside Out
3. Rebel Heart
2. Beautiful Scars
1. Ghosttown

Honerable mention:
Bitch, I&#039;m Madonna]]></description>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I think if I had a top 10 list it would be:<br />
10. The Power Of Goodbye<br />
9. Till Death Do Us Part<br />
8. The Look Of Love<br />
7.Has To Be<br />
6. Run<br />
5. What It Feels Like For A Girl<br />
4. Liquid Love<br />
3. Forbidden Love (2005)<br />
2. Love Spent<br />
1. Drowned World/Substitute For Love </p>
<p>Honerable Mentions:<br />
Arioso<br />
I&#039;m In Love With Love<br />
Let It Will Be<br />
Rescue Me</p>
<p>Also, Im not including the new tracks due to them not yet being heard but heres my top 5 for them:<br />
5. Wash All Over Me<br />
4. (Love You From The) Inside Out<br />
3. Rebel Heart<br />
2. Beautiful Scars<br />
1. Ghosttown</p>
<p>Honerable mention:<br />
Bitch, I&#039;m Madonna</p>
]]></content:encoded>
